# Project architecture

- Runtime/build truth wins: `namma-pharmacy/package.json`,
  `medmate-website/package.json`, Compose, Makefile, and CI.
- `namma-pharmacy/` is the Next.js pharmacy dashboard. It is served at `/`.
- `medmate-website/` is the public site for medmatepharmacy.com.
- Do not introduce build systems, package workspaces, shared packages, or
  generated clients that are absent from the runtime/build source of truth.
- Read `docs/architecture/README.md` before implementation.
- Product notes in `docs/requirements/` describe the previous ERP. New pharmacy
  behavior lives in `namma-pharmacy/`.
